      "body": "FDV1110B\nCopy model name\n4.8\nRead 561 Reviews. Same page link.\n\\|\n561 Reviews\n422 out of 432 (98%) reviewers recommend this product\nShare your thoughts!\n(2)\nopen gallery popup\nPrevious Slide\nNext Slide\nPrevious Slide\nNext Slide\nKey Features\n- DUAL Dry™ allows choice to the drying course, for Energy or Time focus.\n- LG's Auto Cleaning Condenser automatically cleans the condenser each cycle.\n- The DUAL Inverter Heat Pump cycles faster and more effectively, with a 10 year warranty.\n- Smart Pairing™ receives data from compatible LG washers to set the dryer automatically\n- LG ThinQ™ Wi-Fi models allow simple control, monitoring and even download of new cycles.\n- LG dryers use R290 refrigerant, a natural refrigerant with lower global warming potential.\n[More](https://www.lg.com/uk/laundry/tumble-dryers/fdv1110b/#)\n[Ask LG anything](https://www.lg.com/uk/laundry/tumble-dryers/fdv1110b/#) [Tumble Dryers buying tips](https://www.lg.com/uk/laundry/tumble-dryers/fdv1110b/#) [Best Tumble Dryers for me](https://www.lg.com/uk/laundry/tumble-dryers/fdv1110b/#) [Why choose LG Tumble Dryers?](https://www.lg.com/uk/laundry/tumble-dryers/fdv1110b/#)\n[**Features**](https://www.lg.com/uk/laundry/tumble-dryers/fdv1110b/#pdp-overview-section) [**Specs**](https://www.lg.com/uk/laundry/tumble-dryers/fdv1110b/#pdp-specs-section) [**Reviews**](https://www.lg.com/uk/laundry/tumble-dryers/fdv1110b/#pdp-review) [**Support**](https://www.lg.com/uk/laundry/tumble-dryers/fdv1110b/#pdp-support-section) [**Where to Buy**](https://www.lg.com/uk/laundry/tumble-dryers/fdv1110b/#find-a-store)\nDeals & Offers\n- After having purchased, register for your 5 year warranty [here.](https://www.lg.com/uk/5-year-warranty/).\nDeals & Offers\nGallery\n-\n-\n-\n-\n-\n-\n-\n-\n-\n-\n-\n-\nzoom inzoom out\n[](https://www.lg.com/uk/laundry/tumble-dryers/fdv1110b/#)\n[](https://www.lg.com/uk/laundry/tumble-dryers/fdv1110b/#)\n[](https://www.lg.com/uk/laundry/tumble-dryers/fdv1110b